{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18111","headline":"朝归 · 韩愈","name":"朝归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峩峩进贤冠，耿耿水苍佩。\n服章岂不好，不与德相对。\n顾影听其声，赬颜汗渐背。\n进乏犬鸡效，又不勇自退。\n坐食取其肥，无堪等聋瞶。\n长风吹天墟，秋日万里晒。\n抵暮但昏眠，不成歌慷慨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}